    "name_not_used": "FOUNDATIONS-VISION-MISSION",
    "status": "published",
    "user_created": null,
    "user_updated": null,
    "accordion_items": [
      {
        "accordion_id": "3",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>The Commons </strong>are shared resources jointly managed by a community according to a set of rules and social norms that ensure sustainable use and equitable access.</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>Post-Capitalism </strong>reorients production from capitalism’s imperative of capital accumulation towards the satisfaction of societal needs within planetary boundaries.</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>A regenerative future </strong>leverages the commons to restore natural ecosystems and repair the damage capitalist alienation has caused to our social fabric.</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>The liberatory potential </strong>of emerging technologies and horizontal social techniques lies in their ability to empower communal self-governance vis-a-vis centralised authority.</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-06-30T18:01:10.716Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-21T09:12:25.034Z",
        "header": "FOUNDATIONS",
        "id": "3",
        "main_image": null,
        "sort": "1",
        "user_created": null,
        "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5"
      },
      {
        "accordion_id": "3",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">As <strong>an experimental playground for post-capitalist systems design</strong>, the commons hub explores the liberatory potential of emerging technologies&nbsp;and social techniques that facilitate horizontal communities.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">Our aim is to create <strong>a testing ground for the commons </strong>that prototypes and applies these innovations, building a regenerative future in the here and now.</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">By offering decentralized communities a permanent physical home to socialize and connect, we provide a space to <strong>grow meaningful relationships and a shared culture</strong>.</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-06-30T18:01:10.716Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-21T09:12:20.229Z",
        "header": "VISION",
        "id": "4",
        "main_image": null,
        "sort": "2",
        "user_created": null,
        "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5"
      },
      {
        "accordion_id": "3",
        "content": "<ul><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>Rozvíjejte naši komunitu prostřednictvím akcí a partnerství</strong></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>Podporujte aplikovaný systémový design pomocí grantů a experimentů</strong></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>Posilujte Hub jako ekonomický motor podporující místní Commons</strong></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>Vytvořte živý znalostní hub spojující hnutí a akademickou sféru</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "date_created": "2025-06-30T18:01:10.716Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-21T09:12:34.817Z",
        "header": "MISSION",
        "id": "5",
